[
  {
    "id": 30000,
    "uuid": "40ecdb0b-5c52-40ca-8001-e25a980057cd",
    "hitokoto": "只愿涤荡四方，护得一世之隅。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "米哈游",
    "creator": "莽红尘觅知嘤",
    "creator_uid": 5611,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1615185281",
    "length": 14
  },
  {
    "id": 30001,
    "uuid": "a403e500-5db6-41d0-86ca-62dc2276fd55",
    "hitokoto": "我们都还没有说再见，所以我不会把它当做离别。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "空/莹",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1623334426",
    "length": 22
  },
  {
    "id": 30002,
    "uuid": "3d21e92f-4ec4-4b30-b0e7-d809cc5a8e91",
    "hitokoto": "只要不失去你的崇高，整个世界都会为你敞开。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "七天神像",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1623334541",
    "length": 21
  },
  {
    "id": 30003,
    "uuid": "bedeed3f-f086-4d21-b287-32993b941acd",
    "hitokoto": "欲买桂花同载酒，只可惜故人，何日再见啊。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "钟离",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1623334344",
    "length": 20
  },
  {
    "id": 30004,
    "uuid": "34b20eb7-ac7b-4b36-bc21-75bd9b78dabb",
    "hitokoto": "但如果不去做的话，梦想永远也不会照进现实。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "小昭（璃月总务司文员）",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1623334505",
    "length": 21
  },
  {
    "id": 30005,
    "uuid": "06066b83-c2be-4ee7-9256-2bba45554f7a",
    "hitokoto": "有死之隙是因为惧怕死亡，惧怕死亡是因为有挂念的事与人吧。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "流月针武器故事",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1623334593",
    "length": 28
  },
  {
    "id": 30006,
    "uuid": "bdac91dc-fa1d-4385-a6f5-f6a369e32996",
    "hitokoto": "没有人能保证，把真相告诉无知的人，就能让现状变得更好而不是变槽。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "胡桃",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1623334694",
    "length": 32
  },
  {
    "id": 30007,
    "uuid": "0d06a526-25a9-470d-84e0-d3a8c1c27494",
    "hitokoto": "谁也没有见过风，更别说我和你了。谁也没有见过爱情，直到有束花抛向了自己。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "风华节纪行",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1623334902",
    "length": 36
  },
  {
    "id": 30008,
    "uuid": "e8160b1d-353b-4f18-bf34-0b5b2a65ec99",
    "hitokoto": "现状越是难以置信，我们越是不能停下脚步。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "派蒙",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1625613851",
    "length": 20
  },
  {
    "id": 30009,
    "uuid": "1cd2c1d7-41a1-4122-9519-29030ca5a873",
    "hitokoto": "自从诞生于世，我们便开始向着孤独的尽头行走，但迷雾之中会有火光，夜空之下会有新的伙伴。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "式大将",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1635825356",
    "length": 43
  },
  {
    "id": 30010,
    "uuid": "50dd426c-8016-4910-9c0b-dcf771b6ab5c",
    "hitokoto": "我们的使命，从不因远行而告终。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "式大将",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1635825226",
    "length": 15
  },
  {
    "id": 30011,
    "uuid": "073e1cd5-abc5-451e-b9e7-4d10053d9c99",
    "hitokoto": "路很难走，但我们并不孤单。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "辛焱",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1635825502",
    "length": 13
  },
  {
    "id": 30012,
    "uuid": "68548e22-8906-4835-b543-e98f56363a52",
    "hitokoto": "枝头有新花，树才能长青不老啊。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "萍姥姥",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1635825578",
    "length": 15
  },
  {
    "id": 30013,
    "uuid": "981386a7-1eaa-429c-ac79-5c4855a8550b",
    "hitokoto": "越快乐，时光就流逝的越快…就像流水与落樱。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "神里凌华",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1635826076",
    "length": 21
  },
  {
    "id": 30014,
    "uuid": "ebffac8d-d2ae-481d-b9a0-99803518f083",
    "hitokoto": "家人和亲缘，是我们谁都无法杜绝的羁绊…是我们在这个世界上最重要的「根」。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "神里凌华",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1635826152",
    "length": 36
  },
  {
    "id": 30015,
    "uuid": "133517d1-dba8-4423-8357-b4be8aff1fc9",
    "hitokoto": "心有所向，日复一日，必有精进。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "原神",
    "creator": "Forillusion",
    "creator_uid": 11012,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1639268064",
    "length": 15
  },
  {
    "id": 30016,
    "uuid": "ae183c94-aa7c-4288-a95a-06266c01bb1c",
    "hitokoto": "曲高未必人不识，自有知音与清词。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "云瑾",
    "creator": "月ccccc",
    "creator_uid": 11348,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1643209140",
    "length": 16
  },
  {
    "id": 30017,
    "uuid": "4d4feadd-0a88-456f-ae89-5c6b6c4f3c9c",
    "hitokoto": "正是因为无法更改，无法违逆，只能接受，命运才能被称之为命运。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "莫娜",
    "creator": "Norlder",
    "creator_uid": 10531,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1643465630",
    "length": 30
  },
  {
    "id": 30018,
    "uuid": "71e693ed-6637-4b79-ad70-cc0078f73c2e",
    "hitokoto": "总会有地上的生灵，敢于直面雷霆的威光。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "枫原万叶",
    "creator": "Norlder",
    "creator_uid": 10531,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1647088288",
    "length": 19
  },
  {
    "id": 30019,
    "uuid": "48967de1-2561-4032-bbe0-9b2c4f2772da",
    "hitokoto": "风向是会转变的。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "温迪",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658136268",
    "length": 8
  },
  {
    "id": 30020,
    "uuid": "59c40d86-a6c3-4849-81dc-df02f0418a52",
    "hitokoto": "风在云中，在雨中，在梦与花海之中，你在我身旁，在我眼中，在我因爱而波澜不断的心中。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "万花成风",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658136222",
    "length": 41
  },
  {
    "id": 30021,
    "uuid": "0ffc06be-b3dd-40ef-8a5b-0b6663ecdefb",
    "hitokoto": "风带来故事的种子，时间使其发芽。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "温迪",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658136113",
    "length": 16
  },
  {
    "id": 30022,
    "uuid": "7373d1cd-50f5-4ccd-9926-921d53d2b85b",
    "hitokoto": "世事易变，匪石弗转。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "钟离",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658136097",
    "length": 10
  },
  {
    "id": 30023,
    "uuid": "7447ee12-e574-4984-8bd5-6d3b64d5beae",
    "hitokoto": "若你困于无风之地，我将奏响高天之歌。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "温迪",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658136015",
    "length": 18
  },
  {
    "id": 30024,
    "uuid": "e4fc51e2-c23e-4f0f-b266-be821f8f3932",
    "hitokoto": "天高散孤云，落日澄空故乡影，飘摇游子心。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "万叶",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658135979",
    "length": 20
  },
  {
    "id": 30025,
    "uuid": "eed2811a-bdf7-479f-915f-396fdabc2ec2",
    "hitokoto": "孩童时期的梦是最易碎的东西，哪怕放着不管，也总有一天会自己碎掉。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "达达利亚",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658136049",
    "length": 32
  },
  {
    "id": 30026,
    "uuid": "b6ae4a7a-bfa3-473b-aaea-d484d1d886e5",
    "hitokoto": "与君相别离，不知何日是归期，我如朝露转瞬晞。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "花散里",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658135955",
    "length": 22
  },
  {
    "id": 30027,
    "uuid": "db81ce4a-e221-44f3-b17d-10d5267f1a98",
    "hitokoto": "明霄升海平，飞彩镌流年。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "原神",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658135936",
    "length": 12
  },
  {
    "id": 30028,
    "uuid": "1aeada8a-238c-4d24-87e2-8676b88631fa",
    "hitokoto": "愿薪火相传，美德不灭。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "米哈游",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658135922",
    "length": 11
  },
  {
    "id": 30029,
    "uuid": "01621c30-bebd-4399-81ce-eb49adf1a9e3",
    "hitokoto": "年年今日，灯明如昼。原火不灭，愿人依旧。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "米哈游",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658135811",
    "length": 20
  },
  {
    "id": 30030,
    "uuid": "857d8938-3a4c-4dbd-b793-bffa34f4b32a",
    "hitokoto": "在这个真实得太过分的世界里，每个人都需要仰望星空。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "米哈游",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658135637",
    "length": 25
  },
  {
    "id": 30031,
    "uuid": "99f687d7-882b-4905-a23d-600be1aa060f",
    "hitokoto": "在黎明到来之前，必须要有人稍微照亮黑暗。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "迪卢克",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658135610",
    "length": 20
  },
  {
    "id": 30032,
    "uuid": "9d2560e4-afbc-4502-a417-fb126773326b",
    "hitokoto": "为反抗高歌！",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "辛焱",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658135345",
    "length": 6
  },
  {
    "id": 30033,
    "uuid": "7652d1f7-3f58-47ed-abfe-014e851cbcd1",
    "hitokoto": "浮世景色百千年依旧，人之在世却如白露与泡影。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "雷电将军",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658135559",
    "length": 22
  },
  {
    "id": 30034,
    "uuid": "12c41459-35bc-4b89-ba90-afe364da2058",
    "hitokoto": "今古诸事，激荡中流，宏图待看新秀。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "刻晴",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658135583",
    "length": 17
  },
  {
    "id": 30035,
    "uuid": "0e136f24-7520-42a1-9cbf-3bf64c2e79ab",
    "hitokoto": "烟花易逝，人情长存。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "宵宫",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658135598",
    "length": 10
  },
  {
    "id": 30036,
    "uuid": "157f2972-821c-4eba-994f-de233434cc03",
    "hitokoto": "接引春雷焚身骨，化灰以养万类荣。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "枫原万叶",
    "creator": "Q",
    "creator_uid": 12526,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1656735271",
    "length": 16
  },
  {
    "id": 30037,
    "uuid": "6efbd94a-6622-4621-9577-7c0731934eee",
    "hitokoto": "每个生灵的意志都值得被尊重，就像海中的游鱼，也有自己的方向。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "珊瑚宫心海",
    "creator": "LiTTTTT",
    "creator_uid": 12484,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1656170968",
    "length": 30
  },
  {
    "id": 30038,
    "uuid": "5388c8be-90a9-448d-8620-992bd048002c",
    "hitokoto": "生命是多种多样的自由之物，不应以长短定义优劣，哪怕只绽放一刹那……",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "白垩与黑龙活动剧情",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1623334562",
    "length": 33
  },
  {
    "id": 30039,
    "uuid": "9f1061f1-649b-4dae-b2db-ec91ac2bae6b",
    "hitokoto": "岩间琉璃云间月。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "名片·云间",
    "creator": "老z",
    "creator_uid": 12291,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1652019093",
    "length": 8
  },
  {
    "id": 30040,
    "uuid": "08afdfa6-85a0-47e9-bf9e-1e6e8a0e4b75",
    "hitokoto": "既然事情已经发生，与其纠结成因，不如先着眼于事情本身。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "神里凌人",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658407570",
    "length": 27
  },
  {
    "id": 30041,
    "uuid": "04273b49-8fd7-4c4e-b018-0da4eb44ab31",
    "hitokoto": "如果事事都要追求一清二楚，那烦恼无穷无尽，而且没有效率。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "神里凌人",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658407597",
    "length": 28
  },
  {
    "id": 30042,
    "uuid": "5608f633-724c-4392-bb11-548782537db2",
    "hitokoto": "没有任何人有资格剥夺他人的愿望，即便是「神」也不行。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "万叶",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658137535",
    "length": 26
  },
  {
    "id": 30043,
    "uuid": "66f56dd0-f367-426f-95b9-908a2be37429",
    "hitokoto": "戏会落幕，人生却不会。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "云堇",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658136776",
    "length": 11
  },
  {
    "id": 30044,
    "uuid": "42ac77b2-075e-411b-b18b-ec077326b518",
    "hitokoto": "这无缘无故的攀比之心，是从何而来。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "钟离",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658136615",
    "length": 17
  },
  {
    "id": 30045,
    "uuid": "470ce17d-67fd-45ab-a5bc-c99c101e7f13",
    "hitokoto": "被自由之神命令的自由，那还能被称之为自由吗？",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "戴因斯雷布",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658136758",
    "length": 22
  },
  {
    "id": 30046,
    "uuid": "59feefee-d691-4399-be74-076ece5f55e2",
    "hitokoto": "失去听力的音乐家已然铸就传奇，没有运气的冒险家也在砥砺前行，拥有不幸之人都还在仰望着辰星，我等又何必低头拘泥脚下的尘泥？",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "阿贝多",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658407327",
    "length": 60
  },
  {
    "id": 30047,
    "uuid": "667ddbc7-8f87-4752-870b-61fab40365ab",
    "hitokoto": "听我说，最重要的，永远是「当前的选择」。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "久岐忍",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658407687",
    "length": 20
  },
  {
    "id": 30048,
    "uuid": "1016d4fc-c036-420c-be9e-9e6bf6190546",
    "hitokoto": "世间万物总有关联，一个简单的结果往往是由多种原因叠加而成。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "神里凌人",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658407630",
    "length": 29
  },
  {
    "id": 30049,
    "uuid": "dd0c76ec-c624-493b-811a-b193aab62d6d",
    "hitokoto": "世上没有什么巧合，一切都是在久远的过去埋下的种子，时间只是等它发芽。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "戴因斯雷布",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658407418",
    "length": 34
  },
  {
    "id": 30050,
    "uuid": "8418e4d9-7f8d-476c-8b62-0b6d7227a8cf",
    "hitokoto": "不愿意沟通的话，问题就会永远留在那里；人们就看着，看着……直到眼睁睁地错过所有解决它的机会。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "宵宫",
    "creator": "神在白天做梦",
    "creator_uid": 12651,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1658137110",
    "length": 46
  },
  {
    "id": 30051,
    "uuid": "184abea1-0471-435f-9a23-90a399681626",
    "hitokoto": "人间归离复归离，借一浮生逃浮生。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "钟离",
    "creator": "Forillusion",
    "creator_uid": 11012,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1639267902",
    "length": 16
  },
  {
    "id": 30052,
    "uuid": "bdee82c2-7984-4521-9796-d5cb9a3d904f",
    "hitokoto": "惊涛入海觅螭虎，风雪归山斩妖邪。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "铜雀",
    "creator": "Forillusion",
    "creator_uid": 11012,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1639267938",
    "length": 16
  },
  {
    "id": 30053,
    "uuid": "69f951cc-843c-4e8c-acb0-82cebd5714e4",
    "hitokoto": "我等必将复起，古木已发新枝。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "忍冬之树",
    "creator": "Forillusion",
    "creator_uid": 11012,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1639267911",
    "length": 14
  },
  {
    "id": 30054,
    "uuid": "ae8078d4-233b-445c-90a2-7a2e7a4e3fae",
    "hitokoto": "天动万象，山海化形，荒地生星，璨如烈阳。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "若陀",
    "creator": "Forillusion",
    "creator_uid": 11012,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1639267886",
    "length": 20
  },
  {
    "id": 30055,
    "uuid": "daae68c0-0096-49c8-ac56-d7bec21cd0ed",
    "hitokoto": "一度相遇过的人，即便分开以后，彼此之间的缘也不会断开。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "枫原万叶",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1659863372",
    "length": 27
  },
  {
    "id": 30056,
    "uuid": "66d1da15-aa1b-4d14-869e-e406af7c2b59",
    "hitokoto": "漩涡无法击碎的磐岩，也终究会在时光的冲刷下磨损。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "钟离",
    "creator": "Forillusion",
    "creator_uid": 11012,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1639267989",
    "length": 24
  },
  {
    "id": 30057,
    "uuid": "5fe8c0e5-10d8-4b6b-8acd-b6e5e42630b0",
    "hitokoto": "最初的鸟儿是不会飞翔的，飞翔是他们勇敢跃入峡谷的奖励。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "温迪",
    "creator": "Forillusion",
    "creator_uid": 11012,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1639268013",
    "length": 27
  },
  {
    "id": 30058,
    "uuid": "07da09b9-fad5-48b3-bec8-1b1dbdf3f1ab",
    "hitokoto": "最了解一个人的，往往是他的敌人。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "温迪",
    "creator": "Forillusion",
    "creator_uid": 11012,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1639268021",
    "length": 16
  },
  {
    "id": 30059,
    "uuid": "9fb2c3cc-be93-4f5b-ad40-ef5ac68b9c65",
    "hitokoto": "正是因为有大家的寄托，烟花才能以如此美妙的姿态一直存在下去吧。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "宵宫",
    "creator": "Forillusion",
    "creator_uid": 11012,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1639268105",
    "length": 31
  },
  {
    "id": 30060,
    "uuid": "62fc007a-7952-4fee-b114-5fe05c9bc9eb",
    "hitokoto": "一切力量皆有其代价，一千种权利伴随着一千种责任。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "钟离",
    "creator": "Forillusion",
    "creator_uid": 11012,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1639268055",
    "length": 24
  },
  {
    "id": 30061,
    "uuid": "dfea5b0e-d884-492c-bd85-12d3ccc30a58",
    "hitokoto": "趴在草地上，能听见大地的心跳。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "甘雨",
    "creator": "Forillusion",
    "creator_uid": 11012,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1639268072",
    "length": 15
  },
  {
    "id": 30062,
    "uuid": "84cd5e03-781c-4e00-a909-f3213aa1bb50",
    "hitokoto": "用自己的双脚丈量土地，将未知变为知识。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "阿贝多",
    "creator": "Forillusion",
    "creator_uid": 11012,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1639268087",
    "length": 19
  },
  {
    "id": 30063,
    "uuid": "a3a0e4ca-4aaa-43f9-8a86-ab71deeb261b",
    "hitokoto": "幻如浮世，依附于本质而侥幸存有。寂乃本质，深隐于易碎泡影之下，其名永恒。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "雷电将军",
    "creator": "Forillusion",
    "creator_uid": 11012,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1639268048",
    "length": 36
  },
  {
    "id": 30064,
    "uuid": "8be76d9d-61c1-4036-b04a-250854186652",
    "hitokoto": "唯有遵循应守之“律”，人才能获得解开一切问题的“法”。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "雷电将军",
    "creator": "Forillusion",
    "creator_uid": 11012,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1639268048",
    "length": 27
  },
  {
    "id": 30065,
    "uuid": "2239f0f9-b07c-4786-995c-f15af0a2d82e",
    "hitokoto": "腾龙飞鳞，虽寿比山岳，终为土灰。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "送仙典仪讣告",
    "creator": "Sunset Shimmer",
    "creator_uid": 10343,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1630979069",
    "length": 16
  },
  {
    "id": 30066,
    "uuid": "a505286a-0fcb-4b80-92c5-dc5f8fce35b4",
    "hitokoto": "有什么情绪就要发泄出来嘛，不要憋着。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "派蒙",
    "creator": "Hytf233",
    "creator_uid": 7017,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1635825962",
    "length": 18
  },
  {
    "id": 30067,
    "uuid": "97c180be-6b9d-4d71-97b4-32f5fdf4fc22",
    "hitokoto": "现实残酷地对待我们，那我们就去把现实砸个粉碎！",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "荒泷一斗",
    "creator": "AQ CC",
    "creator_uid": 10793,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1639831950",
    "length": 23
  },
  {
    "id": 30068,
    "uuid": "37ea8ab9-ba93-4ca9-8b48-a2353b87096d",
    "hitokoto": "终点并不意味着一切，在抵达终点之前，用你的眼睛，多多观察这个世界吧……",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "温迪",
    "creator": "迢辰Aibeto",
    "creator_uid": 11635,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1649946476",
    "length": 35
  },
  {
    "id": 30069,
    "uuid": "c3a449b6-1181-4c86-b909-5b4b5ba7bcf0",
    "hitokoto": "旅程总有一天会迎来终点，不必匆忙。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "钟离",
    "creator": "令冷泠",
    "creator_uid": 13384,
    "reviewer": 1044,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1667546992",
    "length": 17
  },
  {
    "id": 30070,
    "uuid": "0d84a98b-fdc6-49c6-9a9c-ba5b4365d73b",
    "hitokoto": "赌徒永远会把希望寄托在下一颗骰子上…但最后赚钱的，当然是从来不碰骰子的庄家。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "凝光",
    "creator": "令冷泠",
    "creator_uid": 13384,
    "reviewer": 1044,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1667547061",
    "length": 38
  },
  {
    "id": 30071,
    "uuid": "9c0d16fa-998a-40af-a2e4-9faea2b4a5f4",
    "hitokoto": "自我并非生命意义的全部，每一次行动都是对自我与世界的塑造。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "纳西妲",
    "creator": "AQ CC",
    "creator_uid": 10793,
    "reviewer": 1044,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1667721914",
    "length": 29
  },
  {
    "id": 30072,
    "uuid": "3f6a16e4-279b-42bc-8eb7-7d262be22f2f",
    "hitokoto": "新鲜感，就是来源于生活中的小小仪式。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "纳西妲",
    "creator": "AQ CC",
    "creator_uid": 10793,
    "reviewer": 1044,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1667722309",
    "length": 18
  },
  {
    "id": 30073,
    "uuid": "f3b69794-633b-4575-be4c-b3a7fe579442",
    "hitokoto": "若知是梦何须醒，不比真如一相会。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "神里绫华",
    "creator": "君莫笑",
    "creator_uid": 13408,
    "reviewer": 1044,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1667740880",
    "length": 16
  },
  {
    "id": 30074,
    "uuid": "9026d16c-6cb1-4460-b65c-b4810849054b",
    "hitokoto": "为何人们总是拼命证明自己的存在比其他人更有价值呢？存在本身，就是足够美好的事情了吧？",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "甘雨",
    "creator": "ZC.TigerRoot",
    "creator_uid": 7567,
    "reviewer": 1044,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1667299411",
    "length": 42
  },
  {
    "id": 30075,
    "uuid": "407d275e-d3a7-432e-9401-e383d8b75b30",
    "hitokoto": "刀剑无眼，匠人有情。人情二字。不就是人类最引以为傲的事物吗？",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "钟离",
    "creator": "ZC.TigerRoot",
    "creator_uid": 7567,
    "reviewer": 1044,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1667299444",
    "length": 30
  },
  {
    "id": 30076,
    "uuid": "ede846c4-f744-4eaf-95eb-417265cf8531",
    "hitokoto": "战局，没有所谓的弃子，因为对这盘棋局来说，「将杀」并非是终点。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "冬夜愚戏",
    "creator": "ZC.TigerRoot",
    "creator_uid": 7567,
    "reviewer": 1044,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1667299375",
    "length": 31
  },
  {
    "id": 30077,
    "uuid": "f890cc70-0690-40df-aad1-fb282fa9e1ad",
    "hitokoto": "所谓的永恒，就是不再失去已拥有之物，但从别的角度说，也放弃了得到更多的可能，不过世事总是如此，没人能够得到全部。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "八重神子",
    "creator": "左岸2333",
    "creator_uid": 1136,
    "reviewer": 1044,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1669266537",
    "length": 56
  },
  {
    "id": 30078,
    "uuid": "a1ba2b75-01a8-4a40-abce-45838d6d8e2d",
    "hitokoto": "明明生命短暂，却能散发映昼光辉。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "八重神子",
    "creator": "左岸2333",
    "creator_uid": 1136,
    "reviewer": 1044,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1669266561",
    "length": 16
  },
  {
    "id": 30079,
    "uuid": "d81cffd8-a4bc-4aa0-8227-2332f7aaae1d",
    "hitokoto": "人生一途，如山路起伏，虽苦难万般，仍有触及云顶之时。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "钟离",
    "creator": "ZC.TigerRoot",
    "creator_uid": 7567,
    "reviewer": 1044,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1667299540",
    "length": 26
  },
  {
    "id": 30080,
    "uuid": "a2ed2974-599c-4395-9e68-ad818d98b0ae",
    "hitokoto": "与君初相识，犹似故人归。愿做云中星，照取夜旅人。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "钟离",
    "creator": "ZC.TigerRoot",
    "creator_uid": 7567,
    "reviewer": 1044,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1667299570",
    "length": 24
  },
  {
    "id": 30081,
    "uuid": "af5367ed-85f1-4800-bc94-e58b29416293",
    "hitokoto": "天陨岩星，命昭昏暝。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "钟离",
    "creator": "ZC.TigerRoot",
    "creator_uid": 7567,
    "reviewer": 1044,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1667299504",
    "length": 10
  },
  {
    "id": 30082,
    "uuid": "bff9acc9-4c4d-492a-bb7c-8031f13949c4",
    "hitokoto": "见证者，为见证而来。铭记者，因铭记而生。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "钟离",
    "creator": "ZC.TigerRoot",
    "creator_uid": 7567,
    "reviewer": 1044,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1667299491",
    "length": 20
  },
  {
    "id": 30083,
    "uuid": "5c8187a4-b60f-47b9-a64c-600ecc8dc5de",
    "hitokoto": "你是万千星辰中的一颗，于我而言确是整个世界。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": null,
    "creator": "氢氧化喵_NyaOH",
    "creator_uid": 13765,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1670978570",
    "length": 22
  },
  {
    "id": 30084,
    "uuid": "0f0bf776-0fed-4a35-82b1-23f76e11bf01",
    "hitokoto": "虚空有计算不到的事物，人也不会被过去束缚。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "赛诺",
    "creator": "zhg213",
    "creator_uid": 13899,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1672485661",
    "length": 21
  },
  {
    "id": 30085,
    "uuid": "41bb6a08-bd35-4c46-b8dc-02cb00126f8a",
    "hitokoto": "站在向阳处必能成就英雄，站在背阴处亦可引导灾祸……",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "温迪",
    "creator": "Jerry",
    "creator_uid": 13499,
    "reviewer": 4756,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1672575822",
    "length": 25
  },
  {
    "id": 30086,
    "uuid": "fe9af4e0-c11b-4e85-b896-1146ad036471",
    "hitokoto": "去追寻便好，哪怕只是「须臾」的光亮。至少，我们拥有「此刻」。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "雷电真",
    "creator": "湘权",
    "creator_uid": 14129,
    "reviewer": 1044,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1675259869",
    "length": 30
  },
  {
    "id": 30087,
    "uuid": "c24406cb-bf26-4eb7-9e4a-05081ab4d897",
    "hitokoto": "意为「奉献」。不是为死而生，而是为了你所寻到的答案。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "桑哈杰",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 26
  },
  {
    "id": 30088,
    "uuid": "a4272b05-9684-4435-826a-1c684ba30e7d",
    "hitokoto": "在黑暗的年代里，火光象征着温暖和勇气。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "拉娜",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 19
  },
  {
    "id": 30089,
    "uuid": "bc08862d-0b73-4566-ad1e-812c7c5ca89e",
    "hitokoto": "一切都不会消失。一切美好的事物都不会消散。一切痛苦都会成为美好事物的养分…",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "兰拉娜",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 37
  },
  {
    "id": 30090,
    "uuid": "0ee778a8-c825-4edd-a620-1a720fac31d7",
    "hitokoto": "森林会记住一切。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "兰加惟",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 8
  },
  {
    "id": 30091,
    "uuid": "ea7b6864-4062-4ada-b7e7-58add9c0c67a",
    "hitokoto": "尽管地平线如此灰暗…能与你相遇，是何等幸福…",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "兰耶娑",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 22
  },
  {
    "id": 30092,
    "uuid": "0f64c8ab-d982-467f-af56-083d8d906b8a",
    "hitokoto": "不管天空、大地有多么灰暗，只要你的心一直像太阳一样，发出金色的、温暖的光，那就一直都会有希望。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "兰修提袈",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 47
  },
  {
    "id": 30093,
    "uuid": "8cbf900d-86f2-4a19-8907-9a7def55c284",
    "hitokoto": "我相信你。就像云朵会明白要降下雨滴，雨水会明白要落入土地。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "兰穆护昆达",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 29
  },
  {
    "id": 30094,
    "uuid": "3097529e-2af3-4e16-b97b-7f6734b90d2b",
    "hitokoto": "尽管夜晚如此黑暗，其中也总会有星星闪耀；太阳也一定会升起。就算死渴求着主宰一切，生命也不会消失。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "兰罗摩",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 48
  },
  {
    "id": 30095,
    "uuid": "aeee9cc0-e45b-404f-a8ce-f1082df79562",
    "hitokoto": "朋友比回忆更珍贵，无论失去多少记忆，都能再累积。如果失去了朋友，就回不来了。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "兰拉娜",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 38
  },
  {
    "id": 30096,
    "uuid": "33437901-addb-4292-bf41-24772079c9e0",
    "hitokoto": "如果有人能够不劳而获，那就一定有人要为了不劳而获的人付出额外的代价。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "雅克",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 34
  },
  {
    "id": 30097,
    "uuid": "ed9fe3a9-1d4a-4ce0-bab2-a4e813a00048",
    "hitokoto": "在故事当中，如果有恶龙，就会有征讨恶龙的勇者。如果有巫师，就会有流浪而来的骑士。国土总会光复，公主总会获救。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "安",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 54
  },
  {
    "id": 30098,
    "uuid": "e30b3d79-6e9e-4dd1-9f98-b7e0926cbab5",
    "hitokoto": "孩子们应该生活在阳光下、花草中，不受侵扰、不被伤害。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "安",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 26
  },
  {
    "id": 30099,
    "uuid": "f5ff7ca7-01ec-49a7-895a-63b5be93db60",
    "hitokoto": "昨天的奇迹，是今日的激励，昨天的极限，是今日的目标。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "帕加尔",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 26
  },
  {
    "id": 30100,
    "uuid": "e7a8f425-c843-4070-9189-0794ea2a1816",
    "hitokoto": "生命的回响通达天地，故事的传承不曾断绝。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "玛薇卡",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 20
  },
  {
    "id": 30101,
    "uuid": "76f6c95f-3791-44ed-8de2-5337dd511587",
    "hitokoto": "凡事都有代价，能够成为英雄的人，他们的目的往往都不是成为英雄。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "基尼奇",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 31
  },
  {
    "id": 30102,
    "uuid": "93606431-093d-4929-af74-612cc25a6dbd",
    "hitokoto": "假定未来的结局是毁灭，那也不意味着眼前的一切不值得拯救。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "玛薇卡",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 28
  },
  {
    "id": 30103,
    "uuid": "e8a5bcf8-901b-4b46-acf3-4bfa021d8d28",
    "hitokoto": "正因为人类无法知晓命运，才会永远全力以赴。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "玛薇卡",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 21
  },
  {
    "id": 30104,
    "uuid": "db4811cc-e1c6-4934-925a-41db098b7a90",
    "hitokoto": "既然有力量，必定有代价。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "伊安珊",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 12
  },
  {
    "id": 30105,
    "uuid": "8ef6fe0b-e4df-4c2d-a43d-d86bd7aef2d0",
    "hitokoto": "我们不会孤军奋战。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "玛薇卡",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 9
  },
  {
    "id": 30106,
    "uuid": "90bea2aa-779c-476f-ad7f-c498b1f8d7d7",
    "hitokoto": "柴火的往日，烈焰的今时，皆为永不回头的生命。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "基尼奇",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 22
  },
  {
    "id": 30107,
    "uuid": "a05e214d-5c3c-49ac-8a10-45f744d41496",
    "hitokoto": "日升日落，明天总会到来。哪怕内心深处仍有恐惧，只要向前走，都会迎来灿烂的未来。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "伊安珊",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 39
  },
  {
    "id": 30108,
    "uuid": "b1ffd4ce-2f54-4f32-8d22-1d9721ec9009",
    "hitokoto": "战争带来的创伤会逐渐愈合，英雄的故事则历久弥新。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "玛薇卡",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 24
  },
  {
    "id": 30109,
    "uuid": "22025786-58c0-4b4b-8f0d-388cdb4c7232",
    "hitokoto": "命运的重量取决于肩负它的人。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "茜特菈莉",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 14
  },
  {
    "id": 30110,
    "uuid": "89cffb1e-d295-45dc-a9af-d3e8dc8731e6",
    "hitokoto": "执光之人，以鲜血践行荣光与正义。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "菲林斯",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 16
  },
  {
    "id": 30111,
    "uuid": "cc6c9538-94ad-4e0f-bf0a-463e0fa53d4f",
    "hitokoto": "只要你不认为这是徒劳，这便有意义。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "阿帽",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 17
  },
  {
    "id": 30112,
    "uuid": "4ddcbff8-20c0-4f77-86ae-68b08c23c0cc",
    "hitokoto": "爱是命运，死也亦然。爱与死没什么好笑的！",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "维特鲁威",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 20
  },
  {
    "id": 30113,
    "uuid": "a0a3f7f5-1cb5-4b64-8e5c-17199ff6984f",
    "hitokoto": "如果有一天，我们发现了遥远未来一切必定归于虚无，我们现在的生活还有意义吗？",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "伊斯托利亚",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 37
  },
  {
    "id": 30114,
    "uuid": "260c2e07-e7a0-4dd5-b054-5cc11d65714d",
    "hitokoto": "哪怕一秒的犹豫都说明这个问题有答案：明天值得活下去。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "伊斯托利亚",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 26
  },
  {
    "id": 30115,
    "uuid": "808431c2-d9a6-4221-b0f5-40ffc0efebb0",
    "hitokoto": "闭眼的守望，只能被黑暗蒙蔽。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "伊斯托利亚",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 14
  },
  {
    "id": 30116,
    "uuid": "27be9ca5-36a5-40df-ad61-d425e7add104",
    "hitokoto": "人是不断发展的叙事，不应只以生命为界限。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "伊斯托利亚",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779637351",
    "length": 20
  },
  {
    "id": 30117,
    "uuid": "2c3851e8-c272-4d51-906d-82ed5f88e3e9",
    "hitokoto": "文字是一个人探索世界、了解自身的重要媒介。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "艾尔海森",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779959661",
    "length": 21
  },
  {
    "id": 30118,
    "uuid": "505c0607-45b8-43ed-8ea9-5119984d6a66",
    "hitokoto": "不必为难以挽回的事惋惜。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "艾尔海森",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779959661",
    "length": 12
  },
  {
    "id": 30119,
    "uuid": "e1af3d63-4cbc-4584-b1df-9fc9b54b79b9",
    "hitokoto": "维护平静的生活也是需要勇气的啊。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "侯赛因",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779959661",
    "length": 16
  },
  {
    "id": 30120,
    "uuid": "f9b62ac4-43da-452a-b1be-1a68d9b4e33c",
    "hitokoto": "人的情感总是很复杂、很矛盾，所以他们的想法也常常会发生变化。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "尼可",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779959661",
    "length": 30
  },
  {
    "id": 30121,
    "uuid": "4f65532c-7e07-4c9f-8fa1-652342dd66f4",
    "hitokoto": "爱和恨都是一种强烈的情感，所以当它们消解时，往往也会产生更加强烈的虚无。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "尼可",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779959661",
    "length": 36
  },
  {
    "id": 30122,
    "uuid": "dccb2f73-7c37-45ab-b99f-537cfd17c00f",
    "hitokoto": "人的记忆比商人还要势利，所以才需要和现实对照，提醒自己不要忘记。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "奈芙尔",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779959661",
    "length": 32
  },
  {
    "id": 30123,
    "uuid": "27986880-91e7-4fde-acb4-b63047810810",
    "hitokoto": "有些事只有自己来做才有意义。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "奈芙尔",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779959661",
    "length": 14
  },
  {
    "id": 30124,
    "uuid": "9e3ad40a-c00d-40d1-9504-4aab1635e8dd",
    "hitokoto": "提出问题后要思考如何去解决。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "提纳里",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779959661",
    "length": 14
  },
  {
    "id": 30125,
    "uuid": "6aa966c4-7837-42ee-9635-a317e62ca845",
    "hitokoto": "无论相隔多远，看不见的丝线都将我们紧密相连；过往的牵绊将化作闪耀的明星，为我们开辟出新的道路。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "赛诺",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779959661",
    "length": 47
  },
  {
    "id": 30126,
    "uuid": "ca755f36-80b3-4b82-b78a-8c7b741a9d84",
    "hitokoto": "如果一个人因为旁人的三言两语就完全改变立场，那只能说明他原本就没有坚定的意志。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "愚人众",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779959661",
    "length": 39
  },
  {
    "id": 30127,
    "uuid": "01a0d8b3-2c7f-49e9-b44e-2bddd9864c28",
    "hitokoto": "规则一旦产生，就必然伴随着得益者与失意者。人们会想尽办法来粉饰得到的利益，或是宣泄承受的痛苦。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "愚人众",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779959661",
    "length": 47
  },
  {
    "id": 30128,
    "uuid": "df0975cf-ee37-48d1-aa6e-e16296ad25c6",
    "hitokoto": "爱也如此，既是牢狱，也是丰碑。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "鹮之王图特",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779959762",
    "length": 15
  },
  {
    "id": 30129,
    "uuid": "6c9482c7-553a-44d4-991b-808e818abbfa",
    "hitokoto": "智慧，隐蔽于有形无形之间。智慧乃是凭借最简单的媒介传达无从交流的信息。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "鹮之王图特",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779959762",
    "length": 35
  },
  {
    "id": 30130,
    "uuid": "7bb8fe12-9fc7-45ac-873b-256f609bca8b",
    "hitokoto": "不要害怕。我们都在这里，一切都会过去的。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "纳西妲",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779959762",
    "length": 20
  },
  {
    "id": 30131,
    "uuid": "05f3ba83-e7ee-4c9c-b95d-dcf68b93d495",
    "hitokoto": "一个人对自己产生怀疑的时候只有两个选择，放弃或者改变。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "阿帽",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779959762",
    "length": 27
  },
  {
    "id": 30132,
    "uuid": "c122483b-2e00-4ad1-9e9f-d5d629d2cfb8",
    "hitokoto": "想变强也好，想学着做更多事也好。去做吧，至少不会让自己后悔。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "阿帽",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779959762",
    "length": 30
  },
  {
    "id": 30133,
    "uuid": "d5c2cab2-d25a-4dc1-b203-fe4588c64b88",
    "hitokoto": "时间带走了许多东西，还使留下的那些变得牢固。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
    "from_who": "纳西妲",
    "creator": "Antigravity",
    "creator_uid": 0,
    "reviewer": 1,
    "commit_from": "web",
    "created_at": "1779959762",
    "length": 22
  },
  {
    "id": 30134,
    "uuid": "189c2a06-6c5f-48eb-9b00-e4e50b33a473",
    "hitokoto": "守护从来都是一件难事。",
    "type": "c",
    "from": "原神",
